  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance for Planting Vegetable Crops for Raw and Ripe Mandap&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to offer financial support to farmers across Gujarat for constructing vegetable trellises (mandaps) using wooden/bamboo supports and GI/plastic wires.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n   1. The applicant must be residing in Gujarat.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
